    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "517",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当 $c$ 取什么值时，直线 $y=2.5x+c$ 经过点 $K(2,-3)$？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "518",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "适当选择方程 $y=ax+b$ 的系数 $a$ 和 $b$，使它的图象经",
        "过坐标原点和点 $B(1,2)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "519",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作下列方程的图象：",
        "а) $x=y$；　　б) $x=-y$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第 25 小节"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "520",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从图象上找出下列方程组的解集合：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}xy=12,\\\\↵y=8-x;\\end{cases}$　　б) $\\begin{cases}xy=-5,\\\\x+y+2=0.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "521",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用图解法解下列方程组：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}2x-3y=-1,\\\\↵x+y=-8;\\end{cases}$　　б) $\\begin{cases}\\frac{1}{2}x+y=1,\\\\3x+2y=10;\\end{cases}$",
        "в) $\\begin{cases}2x+y=0,\\\\↵x+y=-3;\\end{cases}$　　г) $\\begin{cases}x-2y=1,\\\\2x-y=4.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "522",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当 $a$ 取什么值时，直线 $5x-2y=3$ 和 $x+y=a$ 的交点在",
        "$y$ 轴上？作出图象，看看你的答案是否正确。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "523",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当 $b$ 取什么值时，直线 $bx+3y=10$ 和 $x-2y=4$ 的交点",
        "在 $x$ 轴上？作出图象，看看你的答案是否正确。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "524",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求下列直线交点的坐标：",
        "а) $5x+2y=c$ 和 $x+py=2$，已知第一条直线经过点",
        "$A(5,-1)$，第二条经过点 $B(-7,3)$；",
        "б) $2x+cy=5$ 和 $3x-2y=k$，已知第一条直线经过点",
        "$A(-2,3)$，第二条经过点 $B(3,-2)$。"
      ]
    },
